    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The 52‑acre campus houses Lakewood Church, one of the nation’s largest congregations, in the former Compaq Center arena that hosted Houston Rockets until 2003.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        15,
        2
      ],
