        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greenway_Plaza",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Kellogg Company moved its U.S. headquarters from New York to Greenway Plaza in the 1970s, initially occupying half of 3 Greenway Plaza before expanding to the entire tower.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26,
        27,
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Wikipedia",
